  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Do you want Rank-up quest? All Rank-up quests ",
      "have three subjects. I will give one quest.",
      "You should hunt dangerous monsters in a field",
      "on time, and come back to me. Also, you must ",
      "come back to me on time. If you don't come ",
      "back here even you finished the quest, have to",
      "do the quest again. Be careful! Also, although",
      "you miss the time, come back and get the quest",
      "again. If you click ok, the time will be ",
      "counted. So, you do better to buy Potions ",
      "before you click ok. I will tell you what kind",
      "monsters you hunt for the quest.",
      "",
      "[Quest Subject]",
      "",
      "You hunt selected monsters on time for Skill ",
      "master."
    ]
  },
